WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.480
- Wait, you did something special though

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:02.737
with your daughters when
you and Trisha got married

00:00:02.737 --> 00:00:04.940
and I thought this was
the sweetest thing ever.

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.310
- Well, they got married.

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:08.210
So, Trisha doesn't have children.

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:10.050
So they got married.

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:13.700
They exchanged rings and
said vows to each other

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:15.267
because I told 'em, "If
something happens to me,

00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:16.827
"you gotta take care of the queen.

00:00:16.827 --> 00:00:18.450
"You gotta take care of Miss Yearwood."

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:20.690
And it was great.

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:22.360
We were at the dinner, all three of 'em,

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:25.520
it was a really tight
conversation, I'm nervous,

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.310
and I finally work up the courage to say,

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:29.150
I'd like to get married and
they were all fine with it.

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:31.130
I said, "But you gotta take care of her."

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:33.130
And I'm waitin' for something
intelligent to come back

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:34.847
and it was the youngest, Allie, that said,

00:00:34.847 --> 00:00:36.472
"We got your back, bra strap."

00:00:36.472 --> 00:00:37.592
(audience laughs)
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:37.592 --> 00:00:40.197
That was it.

00:00:40.197 --> 00:00:42.470
That was the end of the conversation.

00:00:42.470 --> 00:00:44.056
- Guess I'll have some
more cornbread, yeah.

00:00:44.056 --> 00:00:47.089
That's like awesome.
(Garth laughs)

